	(text "ULVO Configuration\n\nVen 1.2V\nIen 1uA\nIhys = 3.6uA\n\nRent = (Vstart- Vstop)/ Ihys\n\nRenb = Ven/((Vstart-Ven)/Rent + Ien)"
