	(text "GN916 module can be operated in stand-alone or all-in-one mode\nStand-alone enables the GNSS part to be operated independently \nwithout turning on the CELL functionality.\n\nHowever this require more circuit around the module and if not \nnessesary it could be removed. Check datasheet for more info"
